{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00182","headline":"延英殿玉灵芝诗三章章八句 二 · 肃宗皇帝","name":"延英殿玉灵芝诗三章章八句 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元气产芝，明神合德。\n紫微间采，白蕣呈色。\n载啓瑞图，庶符皇极。\n天心有眷，王道惟直。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"肃宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00182.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00182","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}